Algility is simple.

We build and deploy AI-native systems for sales, growth, and customer acquisition. SMBs and enterprises. Founded in 2024. I'm Christian Garcia, the founder.

Most companies already own the tools. CRM. Inbox. Sheets. Zapier. A few AI seats. The problem is the work between those tools still depends on people copying, chasing, and remembering.

Algility replaces that glue with systems. Lead comes in. Follow-up fires. Handoff doesn't die. Ops stops being a hero sport.

If you want the product site, go to [algility.com](https://algility.com/). If you want the founder trail, you're already on it.
